WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:09.643
In tutorial 2.5, you'll
use the setup guides,

00:00:09.693 --> 00:00:13.228
so every job outside Alaventra
comes with clear steps.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:19.264
Wherever Alaventra asks for something,
there's a guide beside it, like Show me how.

00:00:19.314 --> 00:00:21.575
Here, click How should I write these?

00:00:22.559 --> 00:00:26.809
The guide opens beside the form, with
your own website already filled in,

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.240
and how long it takes.

00:00:30.105 --> 00:00:33.885
Follow it one step at a
time. Click Done, next step,

00:00:33.935 --> 00:00:36.574
and the guide ticks it off
and opens the next one.

00:00:38.059 --> 00:00:41.559
If a colleague does the
job, click Copy all steps,

00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:44.572
or Send to a colleague to
put every step in an e-mail.

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:50.209
To find any guide, click the Guides
button at the bottom of the sidebar,

00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:52.642
then search, for example mailbox.

00:00:54.034 --> 00:00:58.439
Pick a guide to open it. The arrow at
the top takes you back to the full list.

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:05.909
Whatever Alaventra asks for, from proving
your website to setting up your mailbox,

00:01:05.959 --> 00:01:07.551
there's a clear guide for it.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:13.980
So, open a guide beside any request, follow
and tick the steps, copy or send them,

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:15.531
and search every guide.

00:01:16.515 --> 00:01:22.474
That's series 2 done. Next, keep your
business details up to date in tutorial 3.1.
